      "custom_prompt": "This is a background scene for a point-and-click adventure game. Output a strict CSV list of ONLY the distinct foreground INTERACTIVE objects a player could pick up, use, or examine (crates, barrels, buoys, ropes, boxes, chests, tools, bottles, lanterns, keys, levers, signs).\nRules:\n- One short tag per object, comma-separated.\n- Include a distinguishing colour/material adjective (e.g. 'wooden crate', 'red buoy', 'coiled rope').\n- List each separate object even if identical (two crates -> two lines).\n- DO NOT include background or scenery: sky, clouds, sun, water, ocean, sea, waves, sand, beach, ground, horizon, distant land, mountains, hills, islands.\n- DO NOT include large fixed structures: dock, pier, jetty, planks, walls, floor, ceiling, buildings, railings, stairs.\n- DO NOT include people, characters, animals, birds, insects, or any body parts.\n- DO NOT include vegetation (palm trees, plants, bushes, grass).\nExample output:\nwooden crate\nred and white buoy\ncoiled rope",
      "max_tokens": 1024,
      "keep_model_loaded": true,
      "seed": 1,
      "image": [
        "3",
        0
      ]
